  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2c380ed4fd6ee90ae478e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那是自然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1f314746552184897439de9c8c0473065d97f64cabf90ef920441fc7ec3364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8416222752dc51f4f830ae4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当开始扫除道场上的积灰，\r\n就能深切感受到年末将至呢。……那么，\r\n接下来该扫除训练员室的积灰了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8802b29c630f512bb7d6a61be1c00d092bbbf5baa11549801d338032df8196d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c6a653816d653d5467dca13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭贺生辰之喜。……今年\r\n也能这般为你庆生，我感到很高兴。\r\n愿你安康。无论到何时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3b19e68099051729c5fc30d539eea48ebed2b87903579cea5907598c5efda4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae302713b1dc395106f8c0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早点把工作收尾，\r\n去休息吧。……今天是你的生日吧。\r\n至少在这样的日子，多犒劳一下自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e652c3754a4d2c4ec27fa4e8d71391443f7e4fc279c42beedce3f3d63e98f182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea85dda89182a1601661b008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物吗……既然如此，\r\n就把时间分出来用于自我锻炼吧。\r\n你的成长，就是最好的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b60e16c52c57c5c5ba743c0d641a5dcabeff21ef4190fa7e40a6300882499e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a91cf2109364d896f4e6151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够遇见你这位同志，\r\n我已别无所求。\r\n……什么，非要我想一个？……这可难办了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f7c556c236c635a614877de553371028017e8edff2990d7e570db9404670fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609d492611d21f87c34a8345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了。\r\n记得尽早过目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e2fb16f665b3fdc327f30e7cb8dbb42895f2d2ce2cb86886f7a551e9b45097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac4790ffab97fda465e2b077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物寄到了。\r\n这份厚意，就让我们郑重收下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb5861c80d40349a43f57269511d51d6a39d3f3508f35baa555b834589c7f5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70e175b4594075ae4b90f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成了。\r\n干得好。下次也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fbdb17155b86c9c63004c90b441bfd7d617cbb90e05218df6ee3133beae0399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce88110964853bd0effdfb75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近期似乎有活动。\r\n若有机会，要去露个面吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "62218f809ded6d2f33ca28a2c70ceed2e3429b12d3eab1d52fd19532b39396a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e02c9a13d2d2e3113e113c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中。\r\n如果是你的话，定能取得好成绩。\r\n带着自信去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096c8ce15737864c35d7f7d902482c59f53f28887f76724acbe88bef1efc3d74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88468217b6dbe4aea5341ac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……只有一线之隔吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a03563e812a489f4c8bf7b5a2883f7d9e12bf9093d083401323081096bcd1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9791a874dd0a6c9b6d015afb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级似乎提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa58b8d9d676ccdff6f319a973a696a186cfc24e60d1b2b6c0b0b1c0e4c058b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827351a46b1614289dc1e6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想挑便于调节体温的衣服……\r\n但有时也会仅凭设计来选择。\r\n就像这件一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7254e3b4d0caca1881fbdd8c2d30d8179d603f95f57ebf1fc7f1440a3cf1eb58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62b5f131212a70e3f8cb5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家似乎总觉得我平时\r\n只穿和服。所以我穿这身衣服时，\r\n大多会让人吃一惊……呵，真愉快啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8799ee4ce05dc7bb4f09c634d5b9895fab8bf6e46ebccd7c6db438719178dffc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a9d07760945e3f6788920f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……毛皮是不是有些塌了？\r\n单靠梳理已经到极限了吗……\r\n最近还得再拿去保养一下啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27bd642db9c72d919514c5f7da79419b2ab8e4dff3153060d3cb0a4124e6674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bacc212efc7c45ae55fc4df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，干得不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b1bcb8e755314b80b629da17b4adbeb29b96d15535f443bf1cbffb0231054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02678d8821598ec110cfc8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奏响胜利的凯歌吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b2f0a82a3bbd9dfdc16aabf933bf11307a25fa72d41d3f83e1e5cd5c52b342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce6ae4772cd59696f280ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……只有一线之隔吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a03563e812a489f4c8bf7b5a2883f7d9e12bf9093d083401323081096bcd1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2b427511cf05e6a32e8fa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，干得不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b1bcb8e755314b80b629da17b4adbeb29b96d15535f443bf1cbffb0231054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f59388636262ca1c9ebf8e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身手见长啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e6a28921e125ca2e9f526a66d7298bafc57a069b7cf77db5036f33afa40c194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d343aef290070dfc799f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下，那名为胜利的大轮之花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6e3948b0adb7b8ad6481d8d6bb055b546fa38cc2d12a0b583e097b4a8088ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b03844a0f47dad7cb2833b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37434d908f1b2837eb08ce09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。锻炼\r\n正是那促使开花的慈雨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f024c2f24767560a1584c1936e59f525746c571a35f42bc7798d8fe0d0fa871e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21201a730acd0330e7afe1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是发芽还是绽放之姿，都是千姿百态的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09318ee736f0c53ea8c07003d2c7fe2f7abea2feb945ab278763c82fcf484289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac5e52b8d267cd7a8f316c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我来好好见识一下，\r\n强者们的绽放之姿吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed38f76720f6537bf6dd3a8ecaf355fd720044c58ba57a0ca5c027fa1edd500",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75df02aae5f295b0fc79d64a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c1828bbacddb8bab3899fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉到了……力量的萌芽……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de9245526384dd43f5ccbeee06e94d48a7fc5d2da87e8d7a67e28b10bbd983b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aa8a5ae74ffc36b974e3a23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别太乱来啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5311da4e186f3023d03fd1eb1f74a1bf809ae592b4cb7541d5972c77b133839c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1276"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d8eac5df653dcd8bfc1cfbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是黄金色的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb3ea6400b54d0298f5c52ca65a783963d27b6782fd26898e015733723a63b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1277"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb483cfd2694a5cabea5ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdded8132cfc667e6bebd5dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞄准好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0730e0f9fa290f04d3a55e9050e0464759d1b82b8e3212da8a95f682894fbce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58e5d44a1ec5ad5255999cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，很不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73440765a3b5cdda7f5bf4914c12ebe642edc0de3e38befb3440df712d81d19f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a9370b3324ceb87539343e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed046546d61c8ed6ca5dc48cfde01c6ebc8c0c1ff70fc6023f97a3fb46e99390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:794a90c1441e502f4480bfb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高超的手法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36bf852338d08c45d5f629c31702bf6410a5df85401dd4e271054cc9a31fb47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b7c848865c83898d6622926",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极好，极好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2160fef477778bdd75299cc9eefe4cfc2964acbe6d950f5755b8bdb0690dd00d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb3a5d4002ed7ca0ef39bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运气不佳啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d36a5531bcfd161299bd68b90877376e190766df40f8e8b2fca7e99e72d39268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
